# An enchanted blocker doesn't trigger against toughness 4, nor does an unenchanted blocker trigger against toughness 3 (CR 603.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Infinite Authority
Black Lotus
Ornithopter x2
Plains x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Kraken Hatchling
Phyrexian Walker
Mox Sapphire
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Infinite Authority.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Kraken Hatchling.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Kraken Hatchling > Bot1; Phyrexian Walker > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter#1 > Kraken Hatchling; Ornithopter#2 > Phyrexian Walker)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kraken Hatchling.Toughness = 4
? Bot2.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Toughness = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Kraken Hatchling.Toughness = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Toughness = 3
